been playing for a few months and there are some people playing this for 
years (I don't know when Sokoban was put in the game). It was quite fun 
at first but there are only a handful of levels available and after a 
while it gets a little repetitive. You could argue that a lot of other 
aspects of the game are also repetitive but you spend a lot of time with 
each character doing the same puzzles over and over. How do you all feel 
